1670/c507460478f325a7f4631bb3d467ddec4fa6834d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771473660","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3529740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>WISHLIST NOW &amp; JOIN THE DISCORD &lt;3</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/cd1c581ae5e04c6bbaf91375aa8ab598.avif?t=1771473660\" width=1394 height=305 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bento Blocks\u00a0</strong>is a cozy puzzle game about <strong>slicing</strong>\u00a0and <strong>packing</strong> ingredients neatly into lunch boxes using the fewest cuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/efd61bfebca7b75ffd664eb2ae93217f.poster.avif?t=1771473660\" width=1170 height=419 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/efd61bfebca7b75ffd664eb2ae93217f.webm?t=1771473660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/3c317077c8b485d4502d2222c0c74ba6.poster.avif?t=1771473660\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/3c317077c8b485d4502d2222c0c74ba6.webm?t=1771473660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your culinary creativity</strong> by exploring over <strong>180 hand-crafted levels</strong>, each with its own quirky twist and satisfying solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/c946e3bf58e1a09f81eb554d81560468.poster.avif?t=1771473660\" width=1170 height=351 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/c946e3bf58e1a09f81eb554d81560468.webm?t=1771473660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/162030224115dea40a5a1248ab8585f1.poster.avif?t=1771473660\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/162030224115dea40a5a1248ab8585f1.webm?t=1771473660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play how you like!\u00a0</strong>Unwind with gentle music, bite-sized challenges and calming visuals. No pressure, no timer, play the game at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/eb0a1fc4be8e161386a69290a1bdc151.poster.avif?t=1771473660\" width=1170 height=351 ><source src=\"https: