 and no timers -- play entirely at your own pace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/6e546e0f36cae59f67bfeb5ca8e5ad6e.poster.avif?t=1771473660\" width=1170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/6e546e0f36cae59f67bfeb5ca8e5ad6e.webm?t=1771473660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thank you for reading! Support us by <strong>wish-listing</strong> the game and join our cozy community on <strong>Discord!</strong></i></p>","developers":["SOMETIMES LIMITED"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/ea328300a6ae6a56b018c711fc67c1e6b02a5905/header.jpg?t=1771473660","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3311670/984543043/1db9705b632ea367aa9114b00d8b881c274b0190/1771471358/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771473658","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3311670/984543043/1db9705b632ea367aa9114b00d8b881c274b0190/1771471358/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771473658","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3311670/984543043/1db9705b632ea367aa9114b00d8b881c274b0190/1771471358/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771473658","id":257289825,"name":"Bento Blocks Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257289825/6b3d370a3d86d1330b8013026e63804a899e73f5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771473658"}],"name":"Bento Blocks","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase optio